            "text": "theorem CandidateProperties.force_derivative_decay {ν : ℝ} {u f : VelocityField}\n    {p : PressureField} {K : Set Space} (h : CandidateProperties ν u p f K)\n    (m : ℕ) (N : ℝ) (hN : 0 ≤ N) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 < C ∧ ∀ t : ℝ, 0 ≤ t → ∀ x : Space,\n      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m f (t, x)‖ ≤ C * (1 + t) ^ (-N)"
